@description Rea-Sixty
@author Frank Acklin
@version 0.1.15
@changelog
  - Codename: My Blood is too thick for Nevada
  - New: "Rea-Sixty Input Level" JSFX probe gives the UC1 a true input meter (live even while stopped); drop it anywhere in a track's FX chain
  - Fix: UC1 I/O meter LEDs now light at their labelled dB (e.g. -18 lights at -18, not -17.9)
  - Fix: output meter no longer flickers on a steady level at a threshold
  - Fix: input probe no longer under-reads transients (a -12 dB snare metered -15)
  - New: FX-Learn "+New" plugin picker grouped by vendor
  - New: UC1 EXT FUNCS hidden menu (CS mode) is now user-curatable per plug-in; SSL plug-ins keep their fixed list
